{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30366","headline":"浙东陪元相公游云门寺 · 赵嘏","name":"浙东陪元相公游云门寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松下山前一径通，烛迎千骑满山红。\n溪云乍歛幽岩雨，晓气初高大斾风。\n小槛宴花容客醉，上方看竹与僧同。\n归来吹尽严城角，路转横塘乱水东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30366.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30366","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}